{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \nGO:0000436 carbon catabolite activation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter]\n--[GO:0000435 positive regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by galactose]\n--[GO:0000432 positive regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by glucose]\n--[GO:0061429 positive regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by oleic acid]\n-[GO:0000431 regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by galactose]\n--[GO:0000435 positive regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by galactose]\n-[GO:0000430 regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by glucose]\n--[GO:0061987 negative regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by glucose]\n--[GO:0000432 positive regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter by glucose]-\nregulation of transcription by glucose (GO:0046015)\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/21442\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Z2SzcrazCM9gzMRnxH4WgGbokuvgQrkIZI0ryZgULBE/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nCGD | 8\nComplexPortal | 13\nRGD | 3\nSGD | 1\nTAIR | 1\nUniProt | 5\n\n\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-08-18T20:40:29Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to children of GO:0000429 carbon catabolite regulation of transcription from RNA polymerase II promoter", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-09-15T22:49:06Z"}
